{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover TichuPro, one of the most thrilling strategic card games in the world! Played by two teams of two players, each team competes to reach the required points, while bonus points are awarded to the team that gets rid of their cards first.\u00a0Play the popular card game Tichu online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Online Multiplayer \u2013 Play with friends or challenge real players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Strategic Gameplay \u2013 Use smart tactics and teamwork to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Special Cards \u2013 The four unique cards (Dragon, Phoenix, Dog, Mah Jong) add depth to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fast &amp; Dynamic Rounds \u2013 Enjoy quick-paced matches with an intuitive interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Tournaments &amp; Leaderboards \u2013 Compete in events and climb the rankings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2660\ufe0f Join the TichuPro Community and play like a Pro!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to master Tichu? Download now and start playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce5 Play Tichu today and test your strategic skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TichuPro by Spectrum is an independent online version of the classic Tichu game and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the creators or owners of the Tichu trademark.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022010?t=1764319568","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022010/83f1b1c23e285b5ad16302a3cc0a4aa4402fc535/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764319568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022010/a1820aff49296bd49c466fcbc1887657283f72b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764319568","caps